(0x01a146999ed27dc4950989aa56a62f67, '2026-10-16 21:23:55.218868', '2026-10-16 21:23:55.218832', '2026-10-17 21:23:55.000000', 'Solomiya\n5d\nDear Professional,\n\nThank you very much for your application and your interest in joining us. We truly appreciate the time and effort you put into your submission.\n\nDue to a high volume of applications, we will carefully review your profile and get in touch within the next few days if your experience aligns with the role.\n\nRegardless of the outcome for this position, we would be happy to stay in touch and reach out to you regarding future opportunities that match your background, if that is okay with you.\n\nThank you again for your interest and understanding.\n\nKind regards,\nSolomiya\nЦе автоматична відповідь.', NULL, 0x01a0b007e9ab7e1dbc33ea1ea333f9ec, 0x01a1084464e179dc91356f71aca2a75f),
