(0x01a1a5db33ed7361ab15099a4e5baa1c, '2026-11-04 11:19:28.749200', '2026-11-04 11:19:28.749162', '2026-11-04 11:19:28.000000', 'Вітаю, Віталій!\nДякую за відгук!\n\nВідправляю ваше резюме на апрув керівнику, у разі позитивного фідбеку повернусь до вас протягом 3х робочих днів та поспілкуємось детальніше!\nГарного дня!)', NULL, 0x01a1a548cbcc70cda64f5027eeaf2130, 0x01a1084464e179dc91356f71aca2a75f),
(0x01a1a5df824d797694d50af37215b4fa, '2026-11-04 11:24:10.957551', '2026-11-04 11:24:10.957438', '2026-11-04 11:24:10.000000', 'Hi Vitalii Sotnykov,\n\nThank you for your patience while we reviewed applications for the PHP Full-stack Engineer (part-time) position.\n\nI’m reaching out to let you know that the search is now closed and the position has been filled. Although we aren\'t moving forward with your candidacy at this time, we truly appreciate your interest in SevenPro.\n\nWe would love for you to stay in touch for future opportunities — you can follow our journey and see our latest updates on our company social media.\n\nThank you again for considering us, and we wish you the best of luck in your current search.\n\nBest regards,\n\nhttps://linktr.ee/sevenpro.ua', NULL, 0x01a130a96cc17871b2fb8f10b5990ebf, 0x01a1084464e179dc91356f71aca2a75f),
(0x01a1a6c55fd3738fb6fd99ff79b1bbd5, '2026-11-04 15:35:15.411213', '2026-11-04 15:35:15.411180', '2026-11-04 15:35:15.000000', 'Orgmeter  ·  Olga\nДобрий день.\nДякуємо за ваш відгук.\nМи ознайомились з вашим профілем і, на жаль, на даний момент ми не можемо вам запронувати рухатись далі.\nЯ пропоную залишатися на зв’язку, і якщо з\'являться підходящі вакансії, я зв’яжуся з вами через Djinni.\n\nГарного дня!\nУдачі вам у пошуку.\nOlga.', NULL, 0x01a111b079587e9282964091f89a3dfc, 0x01a1084464e179dc91356f71aca2a75f),
(0x01a1a6c85cab7b4f8d39ef74bb674a3d, '2026-11-04 15:38:31.211714', '2026-11-04 15:38:31.211685', '2026-11-04 15:38:31.000000', 'Hi Vitalii,\n\nWe’re genuinely impressed by your skills and experience. We’d love to have the opportunity to work with you in the future. However, we’re unable to progress your application right now.\n\nAt the moment, we already have many Proxify members with a similar skill set to yours, while the number of matching opportunities is limited.\n\nIf we welcomed you into the network today, we believe your chances of finding a suitable engagement would be lower than we’d like. Rather than bring you into Proxify without enough relevant opportunities to offer, we’d prefer to wait until demand better matches your profile.\n\nAs our client needs are constantly evolving, please feel free to try again in 6 months.\n\nBest,\nLiza Litvinova\n\nProxify', NULL, 0x01a19c7a8ea07cada7c24ae8e36e639b, 0x01a1084464e179dc91356f71aca2a75f),
(0x01a1a6c8ca4e7142a392a3029e9fdb48, '2026-11-04 15:38:59.278067', '2026-11-04 15:38:59.278034', '2026-11-04 15:38:59.000000', 'please feel free to try again in 6 months', NULL, 0x01a19c7a8ea07cada7c24ae8e36e639b, 0x01a1084464e179dc91356f71aca2a75f),
